  "renderedTitle": "Category:Technology",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p>Technologies are Acquired from developing <a href=\"/index.php/Blueprint\" title=\"Blueprint\">Blueprint</a>(s) into their respective Technology using the Commands seen on the <a href=\"/index.php/Blueprint\" title=\"Blueprint\">Blueprint</a> page. \n</p><p>Technologies can be installed using `$$install &lt;Tech&gt;` and will cost $500,000. Tech can be uninstalled using the same format with `$$uninstall` free of charge.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2>Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#List_of_Techonologies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">List of Techonologies</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Common\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Common</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Uncommon\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uncommon</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Rare\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rare</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Superior\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Superior</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_Techonologies\">List of Techonologies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Category:Technology&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: List of Techonologies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Common\">Common</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Category:Technology&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Common\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Oil_mapping\" title=\"Oil mapping\">Oil mapping</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Coal_detector\" title=\"Coal detector\">Coal detector</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_loader\" title=\"Log loader\">Log loader</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uncommon\">Uncommon</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Category:Technology&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Uncommon\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Advanced_woodworking\" title=\"Advanced woodworking\">Advanced woodworking</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Bauxite_detector\" title=\"Bauxite detector\">Bauxite detector</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Jet_fuel_refining\" title=\"Jet fuel refining\">Jet fuel refining</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Gold_detector\" title=\"Gold detector\">Gold detector</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Vacuum_distillation\" title=\"Vacuum distillation\">Vacuum distillation</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rare\">Rare</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Category:Technology&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Rare\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Robotic_automation\" title=\"Robotic automation\">Robotic automation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Factory_specialization\" title=\"Factory specialization\">Factory specialization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Mining_specialization\" title=\"Mining specialization\">Mining specialization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Oil_specialization\" title=\"Oil specialization\">Oil specialization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Energy_specialization\" title=\"Energy specialization\">Energy specialization</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Superior\">Superior</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Category:Technology&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Superior\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Logistics_expansion\" title=\"Logistics expansion\">Logistics expansion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Airport_tram\" title=\"Airport tram\">Airport tram</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Quality_control\" title=\"Quality control\">Quality control</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Reincorporation_computer\" title=\"Reincorporation computer\">Reincorporation computer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Quantum_stabilization\" title=\"Quantum stabilization\">Quantum stabilization</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261008194308\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 30/1000000\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key icwiki:pcache:idhash:220-0!canonical and timestamp 20261008194308 and revision id 1690\n -->\n</div>",
